OL,3,GNEWSAFerries boss says Ferguson
OL,4,Ashipyard should not get new CalMac
OL,5,Acontracts
OL,6,
OL,7,FA direct award of new CalMac ferries
OL,8,Fcontracts to the nationalised Ferguson
OL,9,Fshipyard is "not be the right thing to
OL,10,Fdo", according to the boss of
OL,11,FScotland's state-owned ferries agency.
OL,13,FCMAL chief executive Kevin Hobbs told
OL,14,FMSPs he was "100%" against giving the
OL,15,Fyard new work for two small ferries,
OL,16,Fdespite a pledge by SNP ministers in
OL,17,FMarch.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
