OL,3,GNEWSAFerries boss says Ferguson
OL,4,Ashipyard should not get new CalMac
OL,5,Acontracts
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said delays and overspends during
OL,8,Fits construction of two much larger
OL,9,FCalMac ships were well known, and there
OL,10,Fwas a risk the problems could be
OL,11,Frepeated.
OL,13,FFerguson Marine said it had a proud
OL,14,Fshipbuilding record that stretched back
OL,15,Ffar longer than recent controversies,
OL,16,Fwhile the GMB union said CMAL was
OL,17,Fitself responsible for many of the
OL,18,Fproblems.
